      "created_at": "2017-12-29T12:54:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FearLord\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FearLord:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think you could argue that neither would happen, as she didn’t actually destroy an environment card at all.<span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Thankfully, they ruled this (purposefully) that the alternate condition happens when nothing is destroyed. So, for example, if she triggers this ability and there are no environment cards in play of any kind (target or not), she still gets to do something.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
